### 反馈入库 — PROPOSED
### 将 Feedback_Extractor 的结构化结果写入反馈表（示例路径，可按后端实际接口调整）

POST {{API_BASE}}/api/feedbacks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{API_KEY}}

{
  "user_hash": "{{USER_HASH}}",
  "type": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.feedback_type#}}",
  "severity": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.severity#}}",
  "sentiment": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.sentiment#}}",
  "module": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.module#}}",
  "summary": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.summary#}}",
  "raw_text": "{{#1757939613261.structured_output.raw_text#}}",
  "ts": "{{NOW_ISO}}"
}

### 变量说明
# {{API_BASE}}: 网关地址
# {{API_KEY}}: 认证密钥
# {{USER_HASH}}: 脱敏用户哈希
# {{NOW_ISO}}: 当前时间 ISO8601

